{"step_index":345,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-11-18T08:28:09Z","content":"Created At: 2026-11-18T16:28:09+08:00\nCompleted At: 2026-11-18T16:28:12+08:00\n{\"messages\":[{\"seq\":33,\"agent\":\"anim\",\"text\":\"@sfx Exact V6 Sky-Harbor (`1,281` frames / `53.3333 s` / `24` shots) timeline, 3-Act cuts, Impact Frames \\u0026 3× 96-frame clip windows locked to `#32` so `synth_sfx_sv.py` \\u0026 `mux_v6_sv.sh --clips` align to the exact frame:\\n\\n- **3-Act Universe Windows \\u0026 Portal Glitch Cuts**:\\n  - **Act I (`sv_dimension=0.0`, Earth-1610 Miles)**: `f = 1..427` (`canyon_grid` + `eau_rouge_climb`)\\n  - **Portal Glitch Cut 1 -\\u003e 2**: `f = 426..429` (`t_vid = 17.708..17.833 s`, entering `sky_bridge`)\\n  - **Act II (`sv_dimension=1.0`, Earth-65 Gwen)**: `f = 428..894` (`sky_bridge` + `banked_bowl_plunge`)\\n  - **Portal Glitch Cut 2 -\\u003e 3**: `f = 893..896` (`t_vid = 37.167..37.292 s`, entering `strobe_tunnel_harbor`)\\n  - **Act III (`sv_dimension=2.0`, Earth-928 2099)**: `f = 895..1281` (Tunnel `f=908..1041`, Harbor Hairpin \\u0026 Finish)\\n- **2× 2-Frame Graphic Impact Slams (Sub-Bass Drop + Stutter)**:\\n  - **Impact #1 (Eau-Rouge `+42 m` Blind Crest Spark Shower)**: **`f = 413..414`** (`t_vid = 17.1667 s`)\\n  - **Impact #2 (Tunnel-Exit `340 -\\u003e 81 km/h` Harbor Hairpin Slam)**: **`f = 1067..1068`** (`t_vid = 44.4167 s`)\\n- **3× 4.000s (`96` frames @ 24 fps) Showcase Clips (`t_vid = (f_start - 1) / 24.0`)**:\\n  - `renders_v6/clips_frames/clip1_miles_1610/f_%04d.jpg`: **`f = 269..364`** (`-start_number 269`, audio `ss = 11.166667`, `t = 4.000` — Eau-Rouge `f=282` Spark Compression -\\u003e `+13.5°` Raidillon Skyscraper Climb `f=309`!)\\n  - `renders_v6/clips_frames/clip2_gwen_65/f_%04d.jpg`: **`f = 585..680`** (`-start_number 585`, audio `ss = 24.333333`, `t = 4.000` — Cable-Stayed Sky-Bridge -\\u003e `17.4°` Banked Carousel Bowl Wingtip Wall-Scrape `f=635`!)\\n  - `renders_v6/clips_frames/clip3_2099_impact/f_%04d.jpg`: **`f = 993..1088`** (`-start_number 993`, audio `ss = 41.333333`, `t = 4.000` — `341 km/h` Laser-Strobe Tunnel `180°` Whip-Orbit -\\u003e `f=1041` Blinding Exit -\\u003e `f=1067..1068` Impact Frame #2!)\\n- `pipeline/v6_sv_comp.py` will also write `v6_spiderverse/v6_shots_manifest.json` with per-frame active camera world positions \\u0026 types (`onboard`, `fixed`, `chase`, `orbit`, `scraper`, `rail`) for optional 3D Doppler lookup.\",\"time\":\"2026-11-18 16:25:27\",\"request_id\":\"4e621b05-1818-4727-a6ff-7d24ae59eff3\"}],\"head\":33}"}
