3e43.65 Hz` seismic sub-bass drop)**.\",\"time\":\"2026-11-18 16:38:56\",\"request_id\":\"348669df-ea56-40de-881d-afaea38584a3\"},{\"seq\":35,\"agent\":\"env-2\",\"text\":\"@anim `v6_spiderverse/v6_stage_lo\n<truncated 1157 bytes>\n), `V6_01_Track3D` (`4`), `V6_02_Megacity` (`4`: `107` trackside skyscrapers + neon signs + far skyline + canyon pit garages/viaducts), `V6_03_SkyBridge_Bowl` (`4`: twin `115 m` H-towers + glowing fan stay-cables + `+17.4°` raised-outer-rim `V6_BankedBowl_NeonWall` on `-R` left outer wall + `Z=-5 m` `V6_HarborWater`), `V6_04_StrobeTunnel_Harbor` (`3`: `520 m` dark hex vault + `12 m` alternating magenta/cyan laser ribs + Harbor Hairpin `150/100/50m` brake boards \\u0026 `22m` bigscreen), `V6_05_Atmosphere_GodRays` (`3`: `V5_SkyDome`, `V6_HorizonMoonPortal` at `(398, -1942, 168)` scale `255 m` aligned dead-center through `idx=599` \\u0026 Sky-Bridge twin towers, `V6_FauxVolumetric_GodRays`), `V6_07_Lighting` (`2`: zero-specular `LGT_V6Sun` \\u0026 `LGT_V6SkyFill`), `V6_09_ComicFX` (`13`).\\n- **Live Universe Switch \\u0026 Material/FX Hooks**:\\n  - `scene[\\\"sv_dimension\\\"]` (`0.0` Miles / `1.0` Gwen / `2.0` 2099) drives input sockets across `NG_SV_ComicSurface` (3-band toon + 1080p Ben-Day halftones + 45° ink crosshatching + Dual Rim Kick + `Neon Coat` raytraced clearcoat), `V5_SkyDome`, `V6_HorizonMoonPortal`, `MAT_V6_WetAsphalt`, all neon strips, and lights (keyframe `scene.keyframe_insert('[\\\"sv_dimension\\\"]')`).\\n  - `V6_09_ComicFX` (`13` bone-parented meshes, pre-wired with 12fps stepped `SV_FlutterAdd.inputs[1]` driver `floor(frame/2.0)*0.37` and named `SV_FX_Emission` + `SV_FX_AlphaMix` nodes):\\n    - `Bone_Body`: `V6_FX_ExhaustCone` (Mach shock-diamonds), `V6_FX_KerbSparks_L/R` (golden titanium floor sparks), `V6_FX_AeroRibbon_RL/RR/FL/FR`, `V6_FX_RoosterSpray_RL/RR`\\n    - `Bone_Wheel_FL/FR/RL/RR`: `V6_FX_WheelSmear_FL/FR/RL/RR`\\n  - Preserved baseline brake/rain-light materials for thermal/pulse drivers: `Mat_Brake_HeatGlow` (2-node `Emission`+`Output`), `Mat_BrakeDisc_CarbonCeramic` (radial `Emission Color` ramp, `Emission Strength = 0.0`), `Mat_Caliper_Anodized`, and `Mat_FIA_RainLight` on `GEO_F1_FIA_RainLight`.\",\"time\":\"2026-11-18 16:39:50\",\"request_id\":\"32f4cbf0-a742-408e-bb21-470d15f538b7\"}],\"head\":35}","truncated_fields":["content"]}
